@RaceDay_HostAddress = http://localhost:5024

### List public events
GET {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/events

### Register an Organiser
POST {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Thabo",
  "lastName": "Mokoena",
  "email": "organiser@example.com",
  "password": "RaceDay123!",
  "role": "Organiser"
}

### Log in
POST {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organiser@example.com",
  "password": "RaceDay123!"
}

### Your HTTP client must retain the cookie. Swagger does this automatically.
GET {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/profile

### Log out
POST {{RaceDay_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout

